# FarmSignal web (apps/web) — build-time environment. Vite only exposes VITE_* variables to the bundle.
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides; every value is optional.

# API prefix the PWA calls (src/api/client.ts). Default when unset = same-origin `/api/v1`:
#   - `npm run dev` proxies /api -> http://localhost:8000 (vite.config.ts)
#   - Docker/nginx proxies /api/ -> http://api:8000 (nginx.conf)
# Set the FULL prefix (scheme + host + /api/v1) only when the PWA is hosted apart from the API.
# The backend must then allow the PWA origin in CORS_ORIGINS and point PUBLIC_BASE_URL at the PWA
# (PUBLIC_BASE_URL is baked into the Quality Pass QR links).
#VITE_API_BASE=https://api.example.com/api/v1
